{"id": "86169", "name": "חילוק שברים אלגבריים – xy/b ÷ x/(y+c) (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>Simplify the following:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:0}}\\div{{CT:1}}. \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>Leave your answer as a single fraction in its simplest form.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">= [[input:ans]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Outline:</b> Dividing by a fraction is multiplying by its reciprocal; then multiply and cancel common factors.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 1 — Multiply by the reciprocal</b><br>When dividing algebraic fractions the method is the same as with normal fractions. Turn one of the fractions upside down and multiply.<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:0}}\\div{{CT:1}} = {{CT:0}}\\cdot{{CT:2}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 2 — Multiply and simplify</b><br>Remember to reduce the fraction to its lowest terms if required. <p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:0}}\\cdot{{CT:2}}=\\frac{{{CT:3}}}{{{CT:4}}} \\]</p>Cancel the common factor \\(x\\) of the top and the bottom (we assume \\(x\\neq 0\\)). In this example:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:0}}\\div{{CT:1}} = {{CT:0}}\\cdot{{CT:2}} = {{CT:5}}. \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:prt1]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": false, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "SingleFrac", "sans": "ans", "tans": "fta", "testoptions": "y", "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "1-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "1-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "lowesttermsp(ans)", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "1-1-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "1-1-F ", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\">Your answer is a single fraction, but is not in its lowest terms.</div>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["a", "b", "c", "d", "fta", "ta"], "nvariants": 15}